# L §3.4: "a prices Y by idx input needs an index with a key for the year Y (LOAD-KEY otherwise)".
# The built-in years index meets [S, E] = 2026..2027, which has no key 2015.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

source s "a source"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input cpi[y in years]: num
input rent_wish: money PLN prices 2015 by cpi

ask q1: rent_wish law 2027-03-01
=== expect
refused: LOAD-KEY ...
